  <tr><td>Standard of proof</td><td>Beyond reasonable doubt</td><td>Preponderance of probabilities</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Definition of mischief</td><td>Cruelty, narrowly defined</td><td>Domestic violence, broadly defined in Section 3</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Outcomes</td><td>Conviction or acquittal</td><td>Protection, residence, monetary relief, custody, compensation</td></tr>
